# Netlify redirects for olivercrocco.com
# Format: <pattern>  <destination>  <status>
# Status codes: 301 = permanent redirect (SEO-friendly), 302 = temporary
# `!` after status = force, overrides matching static file if present
#
# Goal: anyone landing on an old WordPress.com URL gets to the right place —
# the equivalent page on the new site, or the Notes page for old blog posts.

# ===== Old WordPress page URLs → new site equivalents =====
/curriculum-vitae       /about                301
/curriculum-vitae/      /about                301
/academics              /about                301
/academics/             /about                301
/education              /about                301
/education/             /about                301
/conferences            /contact              301
/conferences/           /contact              301
/media-appearances      /contact              301
/media-appearances/     /contact              301
/suggested-reading      /publications         301
/suggested-reading/     /publications         301

# ===== Old WordPress blog, taxonomy, and feed paths =====
# These used to forward to oliverscrocco.wordpress.com, but that site now
# forwards everything back here, which made an endless loop (Search Console
# "Redirect error"). Since 19 Nov 2026 they all land on /notes instead.
/:year/:month/:day/:slug/   /notes/   301!
/:year/:month/:day/:slug    /notes/   301!
/category/*             /notes/              301
/tag/*                  /notes/              301
/author/*               /about/              301
/feed                   /notes/rss.xml       301
/feed/                  /notes/rss.xml       301
/comments/feed          /notes/rss.xml       301
/comments/feed/         /notes/rss.xml       301
/blog                   /notes/              301
/blog/                  /notes/              301
/blog/*                 /notes/              301

# ===== Old WordPress files and admin paths: not found =====
/wp-content/*           /404                 404
/wp-admin/*             /404                 404
/wp-login.php           /404                 404
